-- 1. The launch letter: everyone, the version letter of the launch (RoleBriefings.LAUNCH_VERSION).
L.RB_LAUNCH_TITLE = "The gates are open"
L.RB_LAUNCH = "Okay, listen.\n\nThe beta is over. This is it. Bankai Guild is live.\n\nNot long ago this was a few guilds and an idea. Now look at it. One army, one realm, and every one of you in it. That's huge. Genuinely.\n\nNot much is new this time. Every office now gets its own letter, and guild masters get a checklist in theirs. That's it. The rest is up to you.\n\nOne more thing. Fern built us a guild hall: bankaiguild.roachcouncil.com. If you're in the Discord, sign in and walk through the gates. Thank you, Fern. Seriously.\n\nBe cool in chat. Help the new people. Bring your friends.\n\nHave a good game. I mean it. Let's go!"

-- 2. The guild master's letter, with its checklist (built live by RoleBriefings.lua).
L.RB_GM_TITLE = "Guild master: name your people"
L.RB_GM_OPEN = "Okay, listen.\n\nYou run a guild in Bankai Guild. That's a big deal. Bankai Guild is the army, but your guild is where people actually live.\n\nYou can't do it alone, and you shouldn't. Name your people. Every line below opens with one click and ticks itself once it's done. One title per person, and only members of your own guild."
L.RB_GM_MUST = "Name these"
L.RB_GM_WORTH = "Worth doing too"
L.RB_GM_DONE = "[x] %s"
L.RB_GM_TODO = "[  ] %s"
L.RB_GM_JOB = "Job: %s"
L.RB_GM_SHOWS = "Shows: %s"
L.RB_GM_UNLOCKS = "Unlocks: %s"
L.RB_GM_PREVIEW = "(In a guild master's own letter each line ticks itself, and its button opens the step.)"
L.RB_GM_LEGATES = "Legates (%d of %d)"
L.RB_GM_LEGATES_JOB = "Each one leads a raid group: himself and up to 39 guildmates who agreed, 40 in all."
L.RB_GM_LEGATES_SHOWS = "The Legate shield on his portrait, and the same shield by his name."
L.RB_GM_LEGATES_UNLOCKS = "His group in the War Room (The Realm tab): assign and remove soldiers, raid invites, a private squad chat. The Masters & Legates rooms."
L.RB_GM_BTN_LEGATE = "Name a Legate"
